{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgom1yFk7gKxPhE5BvqH7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**My answer:** This page doesn't tell me where to open the account. It's a list of companies with no fee numbers on it. The only useful hint is that each bank has a \"תעריפון מ־[date]\" behind its arrow, so maybe the figures are one click in. From what I saw I'd go try the \"לפי מוצר\" tab or open IBI or Interactive. If that doesn't show a fee table within a minute, I'm back on Reddit.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- **Screen 1:** Tabs \"לפי חברה / לפי מוצר\", then \"מה חברה מציעה לי\", then \"בתי השקעות\" as a two-column list: IBI, Interactive ישראל, Altshuler, Phoenix, IB and so on. Each one has product tags only, like \"קרנות סל · חשבון ניירות ערך\". Dark and dense, so at least it's not a beginner site. But not one number.\n- **Screen 2:** \"בנקים ובתי השקעות נוספים\". The banks show a \"תעריפון מ־01.10.2026\" date, so someone has collected their fee schedules. Mizrahi, Jerusalem and פסגות are marked \"ללא תאריך פרסום\" in orange. Pepper and One Zero are there. Still no commissions, custody fees or FX rate on the list.\n- **Screens 3–4:** A list of issuers and index providers (BlackRock, iShares, MSCI, S&P DJI) with counts, which isn't what I came for. Then \"לא נכלל\" says outright that some company fee schedules \"חיפשנו ולא מצאנו\". The footer says \"אישי, לא מסחרי, בלי קישורי שיווק\". Good: no broker is pushed in my face.\n\n**What I skipped:** The pension, gemel and השתלמות companies (Clal, Menora, Ayalon and the rest), the issuers list, and the text paragraph.\n\n**Where I hesitated:**\n- I couldn't tell whether the \"‹\" arrows open a page with real fee numbers.\n- I'm not sure what the orange \"ללא תאריך פרסום\" means. Is there no fee schedule at all, or is it just undated?\n- There seems to be a gap between screens 2 and 3 that I never saw.\n- Why do IBI and Interactive have no fee-schedule date when the banks do?\n\n**What bothered me:** On a \"which broker\" page I can't compare anything: no commission, no monthly custody fee, no FX spread, no sort or filter by cost. And the investment houses, the ones that matter most for someone like me, show no fee date at all."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2096,"cache_read_input_tokens":9585,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2096},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7a1f61d2-34e9-472c-ac6b-bc7f39a46143","uuid":"04c0f17e-d183-4d4a-aec4-fe902f2bb52e","timestamp":"2026-11-07T14:54:38.976Z","request_id":"req_011Cgom1y2rB6eSWQPbE2zSu"}
